NInfer (https://github.com/Neroued/ninfer) informed the fixed-model, offline-conversion,
explicit-state design. No NInfer implementation files are copied into this project.

Native MTP architecture/state design was also checked against vLLM Qwen3.5 MTP
and SGLang speculative hybrid-state handling. No upstream implementation files
are copied. See docs/native-mtp.md for source links and implementation boundaries.
Chunked GDN uses an independently expressed triangular-solve delta recurrence;
Flash Linear Attention is referenced as an optimization direction, not vendored.

